            {
              "text": "46:1—51:64.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omu mwaka gwa kana ogw'omu busingye bwa Yehoyakimu mwene Yosia omugabe wa Yuda, ekigambo eki kikaruga ahari MUKAMA, kyaija ahari Yeremia nikigira kiti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.1.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 1:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwata omuzingo gw'ekitabo, oguhandiikyemu ebigambo byona ebi naakugambiire nimpana Israeli na Yuda n'amahanga goona, okwiha aha busingye bwa Yosia n'okuhitsya hati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.18.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 18:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.26.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.12.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 12:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Obundi ab'enju ya Yuda bakaahurira akabi koona aku mmaririire kubareetaho, buri muntu abona kuhinduka, areka emitwarize ye embibi, naanye mbona kubasaasira eby'okushiisha byabo n'ekibi kyabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
